# Deliberately NOT ignored, because they are evidence, not build junk:
#   models/*.json          trained weights are committed; the frontend loads them
#   data/processed/*.csv   the dataset is the deliverable
#   reports/figures/*.png  figures are cited in the report

# Third-party chat log (Vedant's private Claude session): kept locally as
# evidence, not published. See docs/context/README.md.
docs/context/vedant_chat_full.txt

# IEEE paper: licensed download (BITS / IEEE Xplore), not redistributable in a public repo.
data/raw/Noniterative_synthesis_of_convergent_Pierce_electron_guns_*.pdf

# Dr. Lalit Kumar's LKTRON PIERCE simulator: his copyrighted binary, kept local
# (the repo is public). Large simulation outputs are regenerated by running it.
simulation/lktron/target.exe
simulation/**/pierce.out
simulation/**/PIERCE2D.PLT
simulation/**/pierce.3D
simulation/**/gmon.out
simulation/runs/
